      "message": "I think this will create the aidl_library adjacent to the cc_aidl_library rather than adjacent to the filegroup.\n\nSince the filegroup could be outside of the package, I think we would want to place the aidl_library in the same package as the filegroup so that the path argument is relative to the package.\n\nAlso, this may create duplicate aidl_libraries if more than one cc_library depends on the same filegroup.\n\nWe might have to do this in a separate mutator pass, perhaps just one for filegroups in particular so that the conversion only happens once.",
